/*
 * stagenet-stall-note.compact — no circuit; Stagenet stall pointer only.
 * Official docs describe midnight_contractState and indexer GetContractState
 * (the indexer cannot fetch contract state from the node).
 * Upstream servicedesk#264 reports that one Stagenet validator is stalled
 * and requests that land on it fail with "Unable to get requested contract state".
 * Compact has no node API. This file only pins the known string for builders
 * who see it while calling circuits. LOCAL-TRUE. No on-chain deploy is claimed.
 *
 * Upstream: https://github.com/midnightntwrk/servicedesk/issues/264
 * Pins: Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23, midnight-js 4.1.1, DApp Connector 4.0.1, proof-server 8.1.0.
 *
 * Built by @kshot9000 https://x.com/kshot9000
 * Email: kshot9000@gmail.com
 * Cardano donation: addr1q8hnl6vl5a6k3rw3n5g3jtte696zcl76kfatzv7gpswa9r0dj7fma6klq55y4ffm7tf0em09udnyhuk4ah92pl5x9jpqjae44v
 * Teams: @midnightntwrk @MidnightNtwrk @midnightfdn @Cardano @InputOutputHK @cardano-foundation
 */

pragma language_version >= 0.22 && <= 0.23;

import CompactStandardLibrary;

